# One line-ending rule for everyone (Claude, Codex, any editor): text files are LF in the repository and on disk.
# Windows-only scripts keep CRLF. Art, archives and Pixelorama projects are binary and never converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.pxo binary
*.pck binary
*.glb binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
